    "chunk_text": "\u00f0a ciddon swi\u00f0e wi\u00f0 Moysen. He clypode \u00f0a to Gode. & God cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: Gang \u00f0u & Aaron & gegaderia\u00f0 \u00feis folc geond to \u00f0am stane; & se stan eow syl\u00fe Hi comon \u00f0a to \u00f0am flinte. & he \u00e6tforan him eallon sloh mid \u00f0\u00e6re gyrde tua \u00feone flint, & \u00fe\u00e6r fleow sona of \u00f0am flinte w\u00e6ter \u00d0a sende Moyses \u00e6rendracan to Edom \u00feam cynincge; B\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t he moste faran for\u00f0 ofer his land be Edom \u00f0a andwyrde \u00feam \u00e6rendracum, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ne fare ge \u00f0urh me. & he ferde \u00f0a sona mid eallon his folce to gefeohte gearu: & forwyrnde Israhele \u00fe\u00e6t oferf\u00e6reld \u00feurh \u00de\u00e6r Aaron for\u00f0ferde & Eleazarus, his sunu, w\u00e6s sacerd for hine. & hi ealle beweopon Aarones for\u00f0si\u00f0 geond xxx daga geomriende swy\u00f0e. CHANANEUS \u00fea wann wi\u00f0 Israhela bearn, & sige on him gewann. Ac hi wendon to Gode mid ealre heortan. & hi gehyrde God, & him sige forgeaf, \u00fe\u00e6t hi ofslogon \u00feone cyningc & his folc samod mid swurdes & gewendon him ham \u00f0anon ofer langne weg, \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fe\u00e6t land embferdon; \u00fe\u00e6t folc wear\u00f0 \u00f0a a\u00f0ryt & & ceorodon ongean Godd & ongean Moysen miclum, & cw\u00e6don: Hwi l\u00e6ddest \u00f0u, la, us of Egypta For \u00f0am \u00f0ingon \u00fea sona sende God him to fyrene n\u00e6ddran, & hi \u00f0\u00e6t folc tot\u00e6ron & manega & hi to Moyse c",
